    </div>

    <!-- Provenance & Craftsmanship Tabs -->
    <div class="fc__prov">
      <h3 class="fc__prov-head">[ PROVENANCE &amp; HAUTE COUTURE STANDARDS ]</h3>
      <div class="fc__toolbar" data-fc-tabs>
        <button type="button" class="fc__tab is-active" data-target="geneva">[ 01: GENEVA CALIBER ARCHITECTURE ]</button>
        <button type="button" class="fc__tab" data-target="leather">[ 02: TUSCANY SADDLERY TANNING ]</button>
        <button type="button" class="fc__tab" data-target="gems">[ 03: verified quality CERTIFICATION ]</button>
        <button type="button" class="fc__tab" data-target="courier">[ 04: ARMORED TRANSIT GUARANTEE ]</button>
      </div>

      <div class="fc__content is-active" data-content="geneva">
        <h4 class="fc__content-title">[ MECHANICAL PRECISION CERTIFIED TO -1/+2 SECONDS ]</h4>
        <p class="fc__content-desc">Every timepiece caliber undergoes 1,000 hours of continuous multi-axis rotational testing in our Geneva laboratory. Hand-beveling and Côtes de Genève ornamentation decorate every individual bridge and rotor.</p>
        <div class="fc__spec-grid">
          <div class="fc__spec-item"><span class="fc__spec-lbl">POWER RESERVE:</span><span class="fc__spec-val">72 HOURS TWIN BARREL</span></div>
          <div class="fc__spec-item"><span class="fc__spec-lbl">BALANCE SPRING:</span><span class="fc__spec-val">ANTI-MAGNETIC SILICON</span></div>
          <div class="fc__spec-item"><span class="fc__spec-lbl">WATER RESISTANCE:</span><span class="fc__spec-val">100 METERS / 330 FEET</span></div>
          <div class="fc__spec-item"><span class="fc__spec-lbl">WARRANTY:</span><span class="fc__spec-val">5-YEAR INTERNATIONAL CONCIERGE</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="fc__content" data-content="leather">
        <h4 class="fc__content-title">[ VEGETABLE TANNING IN OLIVE OIL BATES ]</h4>
        <p class="fc__content-desc">We source full-grain hides exclusively from heritage Tuscan tanneries operating without synthetic chromium. Hand-stitched using waxed linen thread that will never unravel or lose tensile strength.</p>
        <div class="fc__spec-grid">
          <div class="fc__spec-item"><span class="fc__spec-lbl">HIDE ORIGIN:</span><span class="fc__spec-val">FULL GRAIN FRENCH CALFSKIN</span></div>
          <div class="fc__spec-item"><span class="fc__spec-lbl">STITCH PROTOCOL:</span><span class="fc__spec-val">SADDLE STITCH &bull; 8 STITCHES/INCH</span></div>
          <div class="fc__spec-item"><span class="fc__spec-lbl">EDGE FINISHING:</span><span class="fc__spec-val">HAND BURNISHED &amp; BEESWAX SEALED</span></div>
          <div class="fc__spec-item"><span class="fc__spec-lbl">PATINA EVOLUTION:</span><span class="fc__spec-val">ENHANCES RICHNESS OVER 10+ YEARS</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="fc__content" data-content="gems">
        <h4 class="fc__content-title">[ ETHICAL HARVESTING &amp; specialist GRADING ]</h4>
        <p class="fc__content-desc">Every active creation is accompanied by an independent laboratory certificate verifying 100% natural premium origin, optimal pH balance, and gentle purity.</p>
        <div class="fc__spec-grid">
          <div class="fc__spec-item"><span class="fc__spec-lbl">PURITY GRADING:</span><span class="fc__spec-val">100% BIO-ACTIVE RATED &bull; ZERO SYNTHETICS</span></div>
          <div class="fc__spec-item"><span class="fc__spec-lbl">verified RATING:</span><span class="fc__spec-val">quality tested &bull; gentle</span></div>
          <div class="fc__spec-item"><span class="fc__spec-lbl">EXTRACTION PROCESS:</span><span class="fc__spec-val">COLD PRESSED DISTILLATION</span></div>
          <div class="fc__spec-item"><span class="fc__spec-lbl">ETHICAL SOURCING:</span><span class="fc__spec-val">100% SUSTAINABLY HARVESTED CERTIFIED</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="fc__content" data-content="courier">
        <h4 class="fc__content-title">[ ARMORED COURIER DISPATCH WITH LLOYD'S INSURANCE ]</h4>
        <p class="fc__content-desc">Your acquisition is never consigned to standard postal logistics. We dispatch exclusively via private armored couriers insured by Lloyd's of London from our vault directly to your hands.</p>
        <div class="fc__spec-grid">
          <div class="fc__spec-item"><span class="fc__spec-lbl">TRANSIT SECURITY:</span><span class="fc__spec-val">ARMORED &bull; GPS REAL-TIME ESCORT</span></div>
          <div class="fc__spec-item"><span class="fc__spec-lbl">INSURANCE COVERAGE:</span><span class="fc__spec-val">100% OF VALUE UP TO DELIVERY SIGNATURE</span></div>
          <div class="fc__spec-item"><span class="fc__spec-lbl">PACKAGING DISCRETION:</span><span class="fc__spec-val">UNMARKED TAMPER-EVIDENT VAULT BOX</span></div>
          <div class="fc__spec-item"><span class="fc__spec-lbl">GLOBAL CUSTOMS:</span><span class="fc__spec-val">VIP CLEARANCE &bull; ALL DUTIES PRE-PAID</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Quick-Shop Bespoke Modal -->
  <div class="fc__modal-overlay" data-modal-overlay>
    <div class="fc__modal">
      <button type="button" class="fc__m-close" data-close-modal>[ CLOSE X ]</button>
      <img class="fc__m-img" data-m-img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1584917865442-de89df76afd3?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80" alt="Masterpiece">
      <div class="fc__m-info">
        <div>
          <h3 class="fc__m-title" data-m-title>The Sovereign Chronograph 42mm</h3>
          <div class="fc__m-price" data-m-price>RS. 48,500</div>
          <div class="fc__m-vault" data-m-vault>ONLY 2 PIECES IN GENEVA VAULT</div>

          <span class="fc__m-var-lbl">[ SELECT CURATED FINISH ]</span>
          <div class="fc__m-vars">
            <button type="button" class="fc__m-var-btn is-active" data-var="obsidian">[ 01: OBSIDIAN BLACK ]</button>
            <button type="button" class="fc__m-var-btn" data-var="rose">[ 02: ROSE GOLD 18K ]</button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div>
          <button type="button" class="fc__m-add" data-m-add>[ ACQUIRE THIS MASTERPIECE &bull; ADD TO CART ]</button>
          <div class="fc__m-note">[ COMPLIMENTARY ARMORED DISPATCH &bull; 5-YEAR GENEVA WARRANTY ]</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<script>
  document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function() {
    var section = document.querySelector('#{{ section_id }}');
    if (!section) return;

    var filterBtns = section.querySelectorAll('[data-filter-group] .fc__filter-btn');
    var cards = section.querySelectorAll('.fc__card');
    var wishBtns = section.querySelectorAll('[data-wish]');
    var quickBtns = section.querySelectorAll('[data-open-modal]');

    var modalOverlay = section.querySelector('[data-modal-overlay]');
    var closeModalBtn = section.querySelector('[data-close-modal]');
    var mImg = section.querySelector('[data-m-img]');
    var mTitle = section.querySelector('[data-m-title]');
    var mPrice = section.querySelector('[data-m-price]');
    var mVault = section.querySelector('[data-m-vault]');
    var mAdd = section.querySelector('[data-m-add]');
    var varBtns = section.querySelectorAll('.fc__m-var-btn');

    var tabs = section.querySelectorAll('.fc__tab');
    var contents = section.querySelectorAll('.fc__content');

    filterBtns.forEach(function(btn) {
      btn.addEventListener('click', function() {
        filterBtns.forEach(function(b) { b.classList.remove('is-active'); });
        this.classList.add('is-active');
        var cat = this.getAttribute('data-filter') || 'all';

        cards.forEach(function(card) {
          var cCat = card.getAttribute('data-cat') || '';
          if (cat === 'all' || cCat === cat) {
            card.style.display = 'flex';
          } else {
            card.style.display = 'none';
          }
        });
      });
    });

    wishBtns.forEach(function(btn) {
      btn.addEventListener('click', function(e) {
        e.stopPropagation();
        this.classList.toggle('is-wished');
        if (this.classList.contains('is-wished')) {
          this.textContent = '[V]';
          alert('[ PRIVATE VAULT NOTE ] Masterpiece saved to your private encrypted wishlist.');
        } else {
          this.textContent = '[+]';
        }
      });
    });

    quickBtns.forEach(function(btn) {
      btn.addEventListener('click', function() {
        var card = this.closest('.fc__card');
        if (!card || !modalOverlay) return;

        var title = card.getAttribute('data-title');
        var price = card.getAttribute('data-price');
        var img = card.getAttribute('data-img');
        var vault = card.getAttribute('data-vault');

        if (mTitle) mTitle.textContent = title;
        if (mPrice) mPrice.textContent = 'RS. ' + price;
        if (mImg) mImg.src = img;
        if (mVault) mVault.textContent = vault;

        modalOverlay.classList.add('is-open');
      });
    });

    if (closeModalBtn && modalOverlay) {
      closeModalBtn.addEventListener('click', function() {
        modalOverlay.classList.remove('is-open');
      });
      modalOverlay.addEventListener('click', function(e) {
        if (e.target === modalOverlay) modalOverlay.classList.remove('is-open');
      });
    }

    varBtns.forEach(function(btn) {
      btn.addEventListener('click', function() {
        varBtns.forEach(function(b) { b.classList.remove('is-active'); });
        this.classList.add('is-active');
      });
    });

    if (mAdd) {
      mAdd.addEventListener('click', function() {
        mAdd.textContent = '[ ENCRYPTING VIP ACQUISITION... ]';
        setTimeout(function() {
          mAdd.textContent = '[ MASTERPIECE SECURED IN CART V ]';
          alert('[ CONCIERGE NOTE ] Your acquisition has been reserved in your cart. Proceed to checkout to coordinate armored dispatch.');
          if (modalOverlay) modalOverlay.classList.remove('is-open');
          mAdd.textContent = '[ ACQUIRE THIS MASTERPIECE &bull; ADD TO CART ]';
        }, 600);
      });
    }

    tabs.forEach(function(tab) {
      tab.addEventListener('click', function() {
        tabs.forEach(function(t) { t.classList.remove('is-active'); });
        this.classList.add('is-active');
        var target = this.getAttribute('data-target') || 'geneva';

        contents.forEach(function(c) {
          var cTarget = c.getAttribute('data-content') || 'geneva';
          if (cTarget === target) {
            c.classList.add('is-active');
          } else {
            c.classList.remove('is-active');
          }
        });
      });
    });
  });
</script>

